# Eigen Project Rules

- Read CLAUDE.md for project context and architecture

## Development Environment
- **Never run package install commands** - always ask the user
- Use **Bun** as the JavaScript runtime
- All development with **TypeScript**
- **Always run `bun run typecheck`** and `bun run test` after changes

## Project Structure
- Monorepo: `/apps` (applications) and `/packages` (shared code)
- `/packages/ui`: Reusable UI components
- `/packages/lib`: Shared business logic and types

## Technical Stack
- Backend: Bun + Elysia + Drizzle ORM (SQLite)
- Frontend: React + TypeScript + TanStack Router + TanStack Query
- UI: Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui + better-auth

## Code Style
- **ALWAYS USE ENGLISH** in all code
- Keep implementation **simple and clean**
- Use **shadcn defaults** for UI components
- Naming: camelCase (functions), PascalCase (components), domain-based (routes)

## Types & Interfaces
- **Always use `type` instead of `interface`** (except when methods are involved)
- Types in `packages/lib/src/types/[domain].ts`
- Import from `@workspace/lib/types/[domain]`
- **Always discuss with user before adding/modifying types**

## Architecture Patterns
- API routes: `/apps/api/src/routes/[domain].ts` with `auth: true` for protected routes
- Shared logic: `/packages/lib/src/core/[domain]/`
- UI components: `/packages/ui/src/components/`
- Backend domain classes: `apps/api/src/lib/[domain]/[domain].ts` via `Home` singleton
- Hooks: `packages/lib/src/core/[domain]/hooks/use-[name].ts`

## Real-Time Updates (SSE)
- Use Server-Sent Events for cache invalidation
- SSE handlers: `packages/lib/src/core/[domain]/sse-handlers.ts`
- Event builders: `apps/api/src/lib/[domain]/sse-events.ts`
- Create invalidate functions for both SSE handlers and mutation callbacks

## API Client & Data
- Use Treaty client from `packages/lib/src/core/api.ts`
- Query keys: `[domain, 'list'|'detail', ...params]`
- Import from `@workspace/lib/[domain]` not deep paths
- Invalidate queries when mutating data

## File Types
- Docs: `application/eigendoc` (`.eigendoc`)
- Stickies: `application/eigenstickies` (`.eigenstickies`)
- URL params use hyphens, database uses slashes

## Documentation
- **Minimal comments** - code should be self-documenting
- **NO JSDoc**
- Only comment complex business logic
- Use clear names instead of comments
- Keep markdown files concise, focused and up-to-date

## LLM.md
- LLM.md is the single source of truth for the project
- Update LLM.md whenever project structure, architecture or major decisions change
- Keep it concise and focused, reference other docs, files and directories when needed
- Remove verbose or outdated information